Directive_3Player_PassMarker_A=Then, since this is a 3 player game, pass the starting player marker clockwise 1 additional time.
Directive_AllPlayersMayViewStorybookAgain=**All players may again view the Storybook.**
Directive_AllPlayersWeaponTokensBattle=All players take all their {icon:s3_weapontoken} tokens into their hands. For each battle, starting with the upper-most territory (marked by the Occult cube), players secretly decide how many tokens to place into their right hand and extend their fist to the center of the table. Once all players have decided, all players reveal their tokens.
Directive_AllThreeRepairsCompleted_Fragment=Once all **three** Repairs are completed, 
Directive_AsGiftFromWarloser_Fragment= as a gift from the {warloser}.
Directive_BothPlayersBidMoney_Then=Both players take all their money into their hands. They then secretly choose any amount to place into their right hand to bid.
Directive_BuildingTargetedTurnToSabpage=One of the buildings in town was targeted by the {warloser}. Turn to page **{sabpage}.**
Directive_CompleteEndOfRoundActionsNow=Complete all End of Round Actions at this time.
Directive_CreepyMarkerOnScoreTrackLose1VP=Any player with a {icon:creepy_icon} Marker on their Score Track Marker **loses 1VP** any time they would gain {icon:creepy_icon}.
