Directive_CrownTokenMovementReminder=_Reminder: The {icon:s3_crowntoken} token can only move into numbered spaces on the track. If a movement would cause it to move into the start or end space, this movement is ignored._
Directive_DidNotPlaceOnBarracks_Fragment=Any player who did not place a piece on the Barracks this round 
Directive_DoNotPerformEndOfRoundYet=Do NOT perform the End of Round actions at this time. You will be instructed to do so once a few events have been completed.
Directive_DrawUtopianExperiment=Each player then **draws 1 Utopian Experiment** and adds it to their hand.
Directive_EachPlayerCollects_Fragment=Each player collects 
Directive_EachPlayerPays1EstateTax=Each player **pays $1** in estate tax to the supply.
Directive_ElectionWinnerPaysBid=Only the player who wins the election must pay their bid to the supply. The other returns their money to their Estate.
Directive_EmpireAdvancedWeaponryDeck=The Empire has decided to expand by utilizing the implements of destruction which you have provided. You may draw a card from the Advanced Weaponry deck when taking any action that allows you to draw Experiments. When you complete the Experiment you will receive {icon:s3_weapontoken} tokens equal to the amount listed at the bottom of the card.
Directive_EndGeneration_PlayersKeepWeaponTokens=Remove all player pieces from the board and perform the End of the Generation. Players keep all {icon:s3_weapontoken} tokens they acquired.
Directive_EndGeneration_ReturnMasterworkParadoxToQuarters=Remove all player pieces from the board and perform the End of a Generation. Return your Masterwork face-up once again. Any {icon:s3_paradoxtoken} tokens remaining on your Experiments are moved into your Quarters.
Directive_FirstPlayerComplete2AdvancedWeaponry_Fragment=The first player to complete **2 Advanced Weaponry** Experiments 
Directive_FirstTimeReachesFigureToken_Fragment=The first time a player's marker ever reaches or exceeds the **{figure}** token, 
Directive_FixTimestreamZeroParadox_Fragment=Fixing the timestream has its rewards. The first player with **zero** Paradox tokens {icon:s3_paradoxtoken} on their Experiments must immediately 
Directive_FortunateMonarchyNoPenalty=is fortunate as the Monarchy has decided not to penalize them this round.
Directive_IgnoreMobIconsFigureTokenStays_Fragment=Ignore any {icon:angrymob_icon} icons. The {figure} token remains in the same spot for the entire Generation. The first time each player reaches or exceeds the **{figure}** token, 
Directive_MonarchyDemandsServiceBarracksPenalty=The Monarchy demands a commitment of service from their citizenry. At the end of each round, if a player has not placed a piece on the Barracks, a penalty will be enacted upon them. This penalty will be determined by the Monarchy at the end of each round.
Directive_MonarchyListensGenerous_Fragment=The Monarchy is likely to listen to those who are generous. When a player visits the **Regional Advisor** and pays $1, 
Directive_MustFlipToSeparatist=**must** flip their Flag token to the **Separatist** side and lose **1VP**. The Monarchy is not pleased.
Directive_NewExperimentsAvailable_An=A new set of Experiments are available for players to complete. They may be drawn whenever an action would allow a player to draw new Experiments.
Directive_NewExperimentsAvailable_Any=A new set of Experiments are available for players to complete. They may be drawn whenever any action would allow a player to draw new Experiments.
Directive_NoMonarchistFlag_CannotVisit=If a player does **NOT** have a Unified Monarchist Flag token face-up, their **Self** piece cannot visit a Town Location.
Directive_NoMonarchistFlag_OnceAction=If a player does **NOT** have a Unified Monarchist Flag token face-up, their **Self** piece only takes an action **once** when visiting a Town Location.
Directive_NoSeparatistsFlag_OnceAction=If a player does **NOT** have a Separatists Flag token face-up, their **Self** piece only takes an action **once** when visiting a Town Location.
Directive_OutpostOpenForTrading_Fragment=An Outpost is open in town for trading {icon:s3_weapontoken} tokens for goods. 
Directive_OverlapsExceedsCrownToken_Fragment=If a player ever overlaps or exceeds the {icon:s3_crowntoken} token on the {icon:creepy_icon} Track, 
