Directive_PerformExperimentTimeMachineRepairs=When taking the **Perform Experiment** action, a player may instead complete the requirements for a **Time Machine Repairs** Experiment. They gain the VP and bonus listed and then flip the card face-down. 
Directive_PlaceOnBarracksNoBonus=When placing a piece on the Barracks, you receive **no bonus**.
