Directive_VisitTechnicianTradeIngredient=When visiting the **Technician**, you may pay 1 basic Ingredient to gain the matching **Advanced Ingredient.** This trade can only be performed once per action.
Directive_VisitTownHallTradeKnowledgeCube=When you visit the Town Hall, you may trade a Knowledge cube you have in your Quarters for any other Knowledge cube from the supply. You may perform this trade as many times as you like. _There is no additional cost to visit the Town Hall if a token is already on that location._
Directive_VotingTokenRevealVotes_Capital=Each player takes a Voting token into their fist and secretly chooses a side. When all players have chosen, simultaneously reveal your votes.
Directive_WarloserDesperateAdvancedWeaponry_Fragment=The {warloser} are desperate for assistance in the failing war effort. You may draw a card from the Advanced Weaponry deck when taking any action that allows you to draw Experiments. When you complete the Experiment you will receive {icon:s3_weapontoken} tokens equal to the amount listed at the bottom of the card, and also 
Directive_WeaponTokensSpendLikeMoney={icon:s3_weapontoken}tokens can be spent like money to pay for any costs. Each{icon:s3_weapontoken}token is worth $1.
