# passages/00006-RumorD.mws.yaml
RumorD_001=Visit the Town Hall
RumorD_002=For such a small, rural village, the atmosphere was always busy with at least one boisterous argument erupting after the charged words of a townsperson. This lively arrangement intrigued me, and I decided to investigate further.
RumorD_003=While the sights - and smells - of the local civic establishment were certainly an interesting diversion, I could not allow myself to be distracted. I was here to gain insight on the political factions, as I was well-aware that this knowledge could be swung to my advantage.
RumorD_004=I was never quite fond of my visits to this place. However, it was ever my duty to make an appearance and my spouse insisted that I would do well to 'mingle' amongst the folk here. So, I made do within the strained situation and struck up a conversation with the first individual that intrigued me.
RumorD_005=These spirited events - possible more entertaining to observe than to engage with - took place as the sun set and then sprawled late into the evening. I found myself much more accepted in this environment as the night wore on and inevitably the spirits of all in attendance were roused by the spirits from a local distillery. On this peculiar evening, a few persons caught my eye.
RumorD_006=I decided to attend one of several scheduled city council meetings at the Town Hall. {_rnd_RumorD_0}
RumorD_007=**I chose to converse with:**

