# passages/00008-RumorD1.mws.yaml
RumorD1_004=The officer was initially hesitant to offer me any relevant information, but my apolitical line of inquiry intrigued him. When I relayed the possibility of significant financial investment in the village, 
RumorD1_005=he smiled and put a finger to his lips. 
RumorD1_006="I think your fears are unfounded. The {warwinner} are planning on building a barracks in the coming years. That means stability, prosperity, and _opportunity._"
RumorD1_007=The officer then cordially shook my hand. When I pulled away, in my palm there was a small silver figurine in the shape of a {crest}. "This is for your _support_ in the matter. Keep it in your entryway. Someone will return later with a proposition."
RumorD1_009=**Gain the {crest} token.**
RumorD1_010=he tensed. I noticed his apprehension. "I would possibly reconsider," he speaks. Then, with a hand cupped to his cheek, he whispered, "This village sits in a key military position in the country. If I were you, I'd leave this place entirely. Unless, of course, you enjoy living in a devastated battlefield where a village once stood."
RumorD1_011=He then entrusted to me a small metal figurine in the shape of a {crest}. I did not understand the significance of this gesture, but I suspected it would be revealed to me in the future.

