AMessenger2_003=One morning, as I considered the viability of electrical conductivity for use in surgery, the caretaker discovered a small brown letter wrapped in twine upon my doorstep. I hastily opened the note.

# passages/00034-ResistEvent.mws.yaml
ResistEvent_001=Quartering Troops
ResistEvent_002=All players may again view the Storybook.
ResistEvent_003=My cousins and I received a visit from a lieutenant within the {warwinner} militia stationed outside of town. He informed us that the encampment has become overcrowded and the conditions for soldiers have deteriorated.
ResistEvent_004=He called upon our sense of national duty to provide quarters for the leadership until the conflict is quelled. I could not determine if his request, which was met by our combined mirth, was serious or in jest. His face, however, remained solemn throughout his request.
ResistEvent_005=In turn order, decide whether you will support the troops in town by providing quarters. If you choose to support them, Pay $1 to immediately build the **Temporary Housing** Upgrade.
ResistEvent_006=Once all players have chosen, continue to the next page.

