AMessYes2b_003=Armed with this important knowledge, I quickly destroyed all traces of the letter. Perhaps I did not have the ability to change what had been set in motion, but at least I was better prepared.
AMessYes2b_004=Gain **2VP**. Then, discard the {figure} token to the scenario box.

