# passages/00122-TimeMachineExperiment.mws.yaml
TimeMachineExperiment_001=A Time Machine... But, I Thought...?
TimeMachineExperiment_002=Was it truly possible that I had witnessed a way to manipulate time in such a fashion as to journey forward and backward at will?
TimeMachineExperiment_003=Does any player have the **Time Machine** Masterwork Experiment?
TimeMachineExperiment_004=Yes.

# passages/00123-FixIt.mws.yaml
FixIt_001=Accidental Discovery
FixIt_002=Upon a chance return to the Time Machine's underground location, I happened to note a small metal clasp that had been damaged during the intradimensional journey. With a gentle nudge, several paper files tumbled from the opening.
FixIt_003=The schematics were mechanical sketches for items far more advanced than any I had ever seen. I gathered the ideas quickly into my shoulderbag and rushed to my cousins' homes to show them what I had found.
FixIt_004=Restoring the Time Machine to proper working condition would be very important, as who could know what consequences lay ahead for us if it were not!
FixIt_005=Retrieve the three **Time Machine Repairs** cards from the Scenario box and place them, Experiment side up, in view of all players.

# passages/00124-GUNSAward.mws.yaml
GUNSAward_001=Seeds of Conflict
GUNSAward_002=Before my spouse and I had even settled our affairs, I was rewarded not only for my family's numerous contributions to the region, but also for the political allegiance I held (or dreadfully inherited as the case may be). Further promises of considerable clout were made if I were to continue to support the war.
GUNSAward_003=As the conflict raged on, it was clear that with my business acumen, noble influence, and burgeoning scientific genius, I would be a highly sought after ally.
GUNSAward_004=Retrieve the {icon:s3_weapontoken} tokens from the Scenario box and place them in a supply nearby.
GUNSAward_005=Any player with a {icon:storybooktoken} token from Generation 1 gains **2** {icon:s3_weapontoken} **tokens.** _Discard this_ {icon:storybooktoken} _token to the Scenario box._
GUNSAward_006=Then,
GUNSAward_007=Any player with a face-up Flag token matching the {warwinner} gains **1** {icon:s3_weapontoken} **token.**
GUNSAward_008=Any player with a face-up Flag token matching the {warloser} gains **2** {icon:s3_weapontoken} **tokens.** 

