# passages/00139-CoWEvent.mws.yaml
CoWEvent_001=Where Duty Lies
CoWEvent_002=Ah, to be born of noble blood is a very troublesome thing. The townsfolk genuflect in my presence, the local military is willing to accept my generous donations, and the crown feels nearer to me than ever, yet still I am wrenched apart from within. Did my loyalties lay with the state or with myself?
CoWEvent_003=The decision could not rest with me alone, unfortunately. But if my cousins - whom I love so dearly - and I, could combine our interests, the aristocracy would surely take note. Would the region be ruled by a monarchy with a strong, **iron fist**, crushing opposition and caring little for the welfare of its citizenry? Or would the **benevolent** rallying of the people serve us best in the end, despite the additional royal scrutiny it would incur?
CoWEvent_004=Perhaps our early actions had already helped confirm our convictions, either way, the time had come to make a decision. For {townname}, we knew what was best.

