_9Note_017=Renew your vigor with a modicum of rage. How could they construct such a ghastly structure in the vague form of an unworthy clod? The thought set my features to crease into an ugly snear. 
_9Note_018=And yet, set upon by the emotional heft of this abomination, I felt at once reinvigorated. For while love in its most passionate form was known to revive the soul, it is hate which raises the blood to the cheeks and sets the mind to precise action. I spoke a curse so vile I felt the lilacs wilt at the base of the wretched monument and spate upon the ground thrice.
