# passages/00141-TriggerParadox.mws.yaml
TriggerParadox_001=Ease of Anxiety
TriggerParadox_002=The feeling was unlike any I had experienced previously. It was as if I was unknowingly swaddled by the air itself and a cosmic force tore the fabric at the seams, allowing me to burst free. I could feel the timestream mending like the tingle of blood returning to a strangled capillary.
TriggerParadox_003=Unfettered by the pressures of the mundane and reinvigorated by knowledge of the universe's complex inner workings, I surged forward anew!
TriggerParadox_004=Gain **{_rnd_TriggerParadox_0}VP** and a Knowledge cube of your choice.

# passages/00142-ForewordScen2.mws.yaml
ForewordScen2_001=A Time of War : A Memoir Across Three Generations
ForewordScen2_002=Dear reader, it is with great excitement that I offer this expansive work for your consideration: A recently unearthed, voluminous manuscript – an epic memoir written over the course of three generations. It is a work as monumental and daunting as it is groundbreaking; a glimpse into the inner workings of the true scientific mind. 
ForewordScen2_003=Upon discovery of these immaculate pages, I, suffering great personal expense, set forth to ensure the general publication and distribution of this important history. It is a work that will perhaps elucidate upon and justify the eccentric reputations of my forebears. 
ForewordScen2_004=While I admit that I am biased in this appraisal, as it is my own exemplary lineage which is documented, I submit this comprehensive prosopography in as accurate a condition as I can muster. As one will soon attest, it is a chronicle of events of a decidedly fantastical nature, yet my research confirms it to be as true and vital a work as has ever been seen in print. 
ForewordScen2_005=However, I must offer a word of caution to those with weaker constitutions. While these pages hold a brilliant catalogue of achievements, they also boldly depict the setbacks encountered along the journey. Gruesome, grim, and horrifying as they may be, I have included their spine-chilling contents as originally written. As one might expect, in exposing the base components of the universe, we uncover both light and darkness in equal measure. For without darkness, we cannot appreciate the brilliance of the light.

# passages/00143-RumorD6Guns.mws.yaml
RumorD6Guns_001=I distinctly remember the overwhelming stench of lilacs and whatever horrid perfume was in vogue at the time. She was startled as I approached and almost upset the small stack of papers, their faces scrawled with calligraphic writing.
RumorD6Guns_002="Perhaps, yes," she seemed to perk up at my presence and introduced herself as the mayor's assistant. "Perhaps you could assist me. The village has an important choice to make and yet none have made it."
RumorD6Guns_003=She offered me a choice which bore more significance than I would have expected. The town wanted to emphasize a unique facet of the local economy that would make the region more alluring to investors.
RumorD6Guns_004=**The best showcase of the region's wealth was obvious to me:**
RumorD6Guns_005=I chose Knowledge.
RumorD6Guns_006=_(The player with the most left-over Knowledge cubes at the End of the Generation will receive a bonus.)_
RumorD6Guns_007=I chose Ingredients.
RumorD6Guns_008=_(The player with the most left-over Ingredients at the End of the Generation will receive a bonus.)_
RumorD6Guns_009=I chose Money.
RumorD6Guns_010=_(The player with the most left-over money at the End of the Generation will receive a bonus.)_

# passages/00144-RumorD6Confirm.mws.yaml
RumorD6Confirm_001=Confirmed
RumorD6Confirm_002=The woman was visibly relieved by the decision being out of her hands. She would prepare the necessary materials and an announcement would be made.
RumorD6Confirm_003=There was nothing more bountiful than the **knowledge** my family could provide. Whether we would be so generous as to offer our surplus to the village remained to be seen.
RumorD6Confirm_004=From the azalea blossoms to the diversity of species found at the market to the intricate machinery, **goods** were plentiful in the region. It could be very possible that our surplus would be the village's boon.
RumorD6Confirm_005=Nothing could be more direct as an alluring investment than **money**. My family would not readily part with it without struggle, but to display it proudly as an advertisement for the locals was certainly an agreeable proposition.

# passages/00145-GunsAnnouncement.mws.yaml
GunsAnnouncement_001=An Investment in {townname}
GunsAnnouncement_002=Due to the influence of a member of our illustrious family, the town had decided on a sensible initiative to inflate their importance in the eyes of the monarchy. They determined that an effusive display of 
GunsAnnouncement_003=the scholarly **knowledge**
GunsAnnouncement_004=the bountiful **resources**
GunsAnnouncement_005=the immense **wealth**
GunsAnnouncement_006= within the region would best promote the village as an important player in the upcoming political conflict. 
GunsAnnouncement_007=While the squabble was merely a distraction from my most important work, I must admit that I could not control my generous spirit. I found it only natural to aide in the blooming of this valley despite the anguish it caused me. I am, if nothing else, cursed to forever give of myself.

