VariableList_ATOW_004={nameA}/B/C/D/E Player name
VariableList_ATOW_005={townname} Village name
VariableList_ATOW_006={tracker} Space the Suspicion Marker is placed
VariableList_ATOW_007=Generation 1
VariableList_ATOW_008={war} Randomly determines SPLIT to Gen II - 1=tt, 2=war
VariableList_ATOW_009={warwinner} Winning faction
VariableList_ATOW_010={warloser} Losing faction
VariableList_ATOW_011={crest} Variable token reference - Sickle or Crest
VariableList_ATOW_012={figure} Variable token reference - opposite of above
VariableList_ATOW_013={crazy} Counts up based on old man visits
VariableList_ATOW_014={rumblings} Counts up based on number of town hall visits
VariableList_ATOW_015= also: removes HUB page setup upon return
VariableList_ATOW_016={nomore} 1 confirms Town Hall Event is active.
VariableList_ATOW_017={barracks} yes/no - was the Barracks built Gen I
VariableList_ATOW_018={barracksact} 50/50 chance of barracks being forced
VariableList_ATOW_019={sep} "win" or "lose" - confirms bonus for faction support
VariableList_ATOW_020={mon} "win" or "lose" - confirms bonus for faction support
VariableList_ATOW_021={rumor} Array of potential visits, reduces as visited
VariableList_ATOW_022={opt1}/2 Options from {rumor} array to visit
VariableList_ATOW_023={rumor1}/2/3... Marks visited Town Hall options
VariableList_ATOW_024={th} Town Hall Event counter
VariableList_ATOW_025={gunsbonus} 1,2,3 - Locks in Gen I competitive bonus
