# passages/00234-WhoopsUtopianb.mws.yaml
WhoopsUtopianb_001=How they arrived was a mystery, but who or what gifted them to me was not my concern. Their utility was universal and their rigorous specifications unmatched. With these experiments, I could work towards a true Utopia - a world of technological perfection. 
WhoopsUtopianb_002=If one could procure the additional materials required to create them, I was convinced that these devious advanced devices would allow me to achieve the recognition I truly deserved.

