_2PAfternoonBidRes_005=I choose to keep the {teaopt}.

# passages/00293-MartialSepEventa.mws.yaml
MartialSepEventa_001=BRIBE
MartialSepEventa_002=**The Region Needs Convincing**
MartialSepEventa_003=All players take their money into their hands. Players secretly choose any amount to place into their right hand to add to the total bribe fund.
MartialSepEventa_004=Once all players are ready, reveal the amount of money simultaneously.
MartialSepEventa_005=The Military requires **${milit} total** from all players in order for our bribe to be successful. **If our bribe is successful**, we will be able to **substitute a** {icon:s3_weapontoken} **token for a single Ingredient when performing Experiments**. 
MartialSepEventa_006=_If successful,_ **all** _money contributed by the players will be returned to the supply. If unsuccessful, the players keep any money contributed._
MartialSepEventa_007=Click here to start the bribe...

