Reign7c2_001=Thank You, {reigntemp}
Reign7c2_002=The advisor, when he regained his sense, thanked me for the assistance. I thrice reminded him to refer to me as {reigntemp}. Ah, {reigntemp}. Such a glorious title!

# passages/00314-Reign7b.mws.yaml
Reign7b_001=Delayed Thanks
Reign7b_002=The advisor, when he resumed consciousness, thanked me for the assistance. I informed him that the business was secured and the people would be overjoyed with his decisiveness. 

# passages/00315-SeedResolution.mws.yaml
SeedResolution_001=A Place of Knowledge
SeedResolution_002=A Wealth of Goods
SeedResolution_003=An Investor's Paradise
SeedResolution_004=Even in their sunset years, my parents operated their business interests with a voracity - and veracity - that could only be seen to be believed. If I can be perfectly quaint, the glitter of coin held little interest to me, yet the wondrous things which I could procure with it certainly reignited the fires of ambition within me as my hair grew ever ashen.
SeedResolution_005=Soon, it was impossible for {townname}to ignore the genius that existed just outside its very limits. The region would be celebrated for the **money** my family had brought to it, and I savored the victory from the shadows, knowing I would reap all the benefits.
SeedResolution_006=I watched from my clandestine position as a singular corner in the secret laboratory became a storage place for various notes and torn pages from old manuscripts. With each passing evening, this obsessive collection of knowledge spilled onto the stone floors and tacked up on the walls like an artist's studio, spreading across the room like brown leaves on a brilliant vine. Such a wealth of knowledge, the likes of which I had never witnessed in all of my years at university.
SeedResolution_007=Soon, it was impossible for {townname}to ignore the genius that existed just outside its very limits. The region would be celebrated for the **knowledge** my family had brought to it, and I savored the victory from the shadows, knowing I would reap all the benefits.
SeedResolution_008=Ingredients lay stacked in haphazard piles along the stone floor of the laboratory. The estate grounds were well-grazed by the exotic display of zoological treats my parents collected. It was difficult to maintain my secretive ruse as an oblivious family member with such a wealth of potential hiding just below my feet. It was a magnificent sight.
SeedResolution_009=Soon, it was impossible for {townname}to ignore the genius that existed just outside its very limits. The region would be celebrated for the **goods** my family had brought to it, and I savored the victory from the shadows, knowing I would reap all the benefits.
SeedResolution_010=The player with the Storybook token on their Estate gains **gains $2** and **gains a Compulsion**. Then, return the Storybook token to the supply.
SeedResolution_011=The player with the Storybook token on their Estate **gains 1 Knowledge cube of their choice** and **gains a Compulsion**. Then, return the Storybook token to the supply.
SeedResolution_012=The player with the Storybook token on their Estate **gains 1 Ingredient of their choice** and **gains a Compulsion**. Then, return the Storybook token to the supply.

